# ApoVault — ignore all local state; commit only team-owned knowledge + shared templates.
# Allowlist approach: everything under .apo/ is ignored except 01_Knowledge/ (minus _pending/),
# 04_Templates/, and gating.json. New transient dirs (inbox/, outbox/, log/, _quarantine-*,
# etc.) are ignored automatically without enumeration. The **/ prefix matches .apo/ at any
# depth, so nested monorepo vaults follow the same rules.
**/.apo/**
!**/.apo/01_Knowledge/
!**/.apo/01_Knowledge/**
**/.apo/01_Knowledge/_pending/
!**/.apo/04_Templates/
!**/.apo/04_Templates/**
!**/.apo/gating.json
